# Club & Grub - level texts of the Book I co-op files of Crystal Grotto, Feast Land C, world 4 and the Way Home,
# English. Owner: level designer DB3 (docs/expansion/PLAN.md 6.1, workflow 9). A level sub-catalogue: loaded beside
# locale/en.po (scripts/ui/ui_kit.gd), never offered as a language. Keys: the `text=` keys of signs and hint zones of
# levels/w3_l2_coop.lvl, levels/bonus_c_coop.lvl, levels/w4_l1_coop.lvl, levels/w4_l2_coop.lvl,
# levels/w4_l2b_coop.lvl and levels/ending_coop.lvl (their names are the Book I names of locale/en.po). Every text
# fits three sign lines (LEVEL_DESIGN.md 15.6).
msgid ""
msgstr ""
